  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Sea-level projections were generated for five communities in Nunavut under the Nunavut Climate Change Partnership.  The projections were incorporated into climate change adaptation reports prepared by representatives of the Canadian Institute of Planners.  The sea-level projections take into account vertical crustal motion and uneven redistribution of meltwater from glaciers and ice sheets."
